test-results/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Reports are regenerated by `npm test` / `npm run lighthouse`; the committed
# copies under shots/ and lighthouse/ are the ones referenced in the README.
# The full Lighthouse JSON (several MB each) stays local; the HTML report and
# the summary are enough to read the run.
lighthouse/*.json
!lighthouse/summary.json
